    {
      "text": "Originally from the tropics, EXEGGUTOR’s heads grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall, they group to form an EXEGGCUTE.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is called “The Walking Tropical Rainforest.” Each of the nuts has a face and a will of its own.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that on rare occasions, one of its heads will drop off and continue on as an EXEGGCUTE.",
